      <title>SoftBank’s Next $100 Billion Underscores Ray Dalio’s AI Warning</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-10-11/softbank-s-next-100-billion-underscores-ray-dalio-s-ai-warning</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">c980c5d41cf637b3ec033dd0</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 20:01:02 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Skeptics of the artificial investment boom are doubling down. Billionaire Ray Dalio warned last week that the bubble was near its bursting point, while Michael Burry of the Big Short fame brought forward the timeline for his bearish thesis. SoftBank Group Corp. founder Masayoshi Son’s attempt to set up another $100 billion AI-focused venture capital fund will only give the doubters more ammunition.</description>
